# Lane-4 results: the .jsonl rows ARE the evidence and are committed (they
# carry a machine id and an engine-binary sha256, so a row is meaningful
# outside the machine that produced it).
#
# The work directories are not: they hold per-probe engine logs, console logs,
# raw recordings and backend-verdict sidecars, which are large, machine-local
# and regenerated on every run.
_work/
_envelope_work/
